                            end
                            Text "A 5,661-line self-hosted compiler pipeline with Lexer, Parser, AST, Semantic Analyzer, and Bytecode Emitter written entirely in pure AAYU." fontSize="14px" color="#9ca3af" lineHeight="1.6"
