                    Text "Get In Touch" fontSize="36px" fontWeight="800" color="#ffffff"
                    Text "Want to collaborate on compiler development, AI systems, or discuss Intent-to-Silicon? Reach out across any of my channels:" fontSize="17px" color="#d1d5db"
